'''Reindeer''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife obtainable completing Santa's List during the [[Christmas Event 2025]]. 

== Appearance ==
It is a brown knife with a black handle, on the knife itself there is a cartoon reindeer on the blade who has a red shirt, blushed cheeks, and small antlers. hence the name.